Package: rottensshrimp
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Cyril Lamy <cyril.lamy@gmail.com>
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: RottenSSHrimp - SSH, RDP and VNC connection manager
 A connection manager written in Free Pascal / Lazarus: a folder tree of hosts,
 tabbed SSH terminals, RDP and VNC sessions, SSH jump hosts, a
 credential manager, Docker/Podman containers and Kubernetes pods.
 .
 Connections and secrets live in a single encrypted .rsh document (Argon2id +
 XChaCha20-Poly1305): hostnames, usernames and ports are as unreadable at rest
 as the passwords, so a stolen file without the master password yields no map
 of your infrastructure.
 .
 Free software under GPL v3 or later. Ships a patched libvncclient
 (GPL-2.0-or-later) whose corresponding source is in
 /usr/share/doc/rottensshrimp/source/libvnc; see
 /usr/share/doc/rottensshrimp/LICENSES/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
